      "font_size": 9.963,
      "raw_text": "is a form of information flow control (IFC) 1 4 11 e.g., [ value-dependent classification [ Our separation logic supports fine-grained concurrency Our separation logic is higher-order Our separation logic is relational Our separation logic provides a powerful invariant mech- 17",
      "extractor": "pypdf_fallback"
